Third-party notes:
- IR code libraries under assets/ir/ derive from community Flipper-format .ir
  collections; used as data inputs to build a transmit blob.
- The "critter" voice (firmware/main/fox_sam.c) is an original synth, NOT the
  reverse-engineered SAM port, chosen to avoid that code's licensing ambiguity.
